            <div class="col-12 mt-7 mt-lg-0 col-lg-5 ">

	            
                                    <div class="one-column-text-block-text">
                        <p><strong>Hier finden Sie alle aktuellen Termine:</strong></p>
                    </div>
	            
				                        <a href="https://xeinkauf.de/kalender" class="btn btn-outline-primary two-column-content-section-btn mb-4 mobile-btn">
